zfp_nrp is a native Rust port of the zfp library v1.0.1, by Lawrence Livermore National
Security, LLC (https://github.com/LLNL/zfp). It is distributed under zfp's licence, which
follows. zfp's copyright notices are retained, and the port's own work, Copyright 2026
OctoKeights, is offered under the same terms.

